    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mudrock, they're hunting down the last fugitives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "They could have just left the fugitives to fend for themselves in the mountains. Capturing them will save their lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't tell if they're being cruel or kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones who didn't follow us are not our problem, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to avoid the search parties. We need to get out of here before winter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's already cold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And go where?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been wandering for so long. Where does it end? It definitely won't end well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, let's go home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "We go back and find a quiet patch of woods. And we survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about our fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "For now... we live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "To live, just to live, we are fighting the world every day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going home? To what home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what about us? We're not Sarkaz. That's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are companions of Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "There may be no place for Sarkaz outside of Kazdel. But in Kazdel, there is a place for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not because of tolerance. But because there is... nothing there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel... is not a city. Not a country. Technically, it is just a region.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "A land of exiles where we are not allowed to build homes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel... is where the homeless go. A land of rootless people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is where you belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we can live in peace in Kazdel. It's full of Infected Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Leithanien's leniency toward the Infected is ultimately just a product of the popularity of bloodlines and Originium Arts. It doesn't mean they truly accept you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "As soon as the mask came off, the very first to be ostracized were still the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not just Oripathy. This rich country has forgotten all the depressed corners of our world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "A tragedy like Wolumonde's is just a mild annoyance for the aristocrats. It's a topic of conversation for the bankers and court artists at tea time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't accept it. We won't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "So we leave. We'll go to Kazdel. Let's see your hometown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Will Leithanien come after us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe. Regardless of what happened before, a group of Infected Sarkaz showed up and destroyed a town. Piss-poor optics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Severin knows the truth. Would he try to frame us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He would.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": ".......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just the way he does things. Based on the information he has, he will do what causes the least amount of damage to his town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we have to get out of here quickly, or all of Leithanien is going to come down on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. So we must figure out a route soon... Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry. Wait a moment. I have to go somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
